1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.thepeerage.com/p527.htm#i5262]
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine de Balsac was the daughter of Guillaume de Balsac, Seigneur d'Entragues et Marcoussins and Louise d'Humieres. She married Esmé Stuart, 1st Duke of Lennox, son of John Stuart, 5th Seigneur d'Aubigny and Anne de la Queuill
2 CONC e, circa 1572. She died circa 1631/32.
2 CONT      Her married name became Stewart. Children of Catherine de Balsac and Esmé Stuart, 1st Duke of Lennox 1.Lady Mary Stewart+ d. 11 Aug 1644 2.Gabrielle Stewart 3.Lady Henrietta Stuart+ b. c 1573, d. 2 Sep 1642 4.Ludovic Stewart,
2 CONC  2nd Duke of Lennox+ b. 29 Sep 1574, d. 16 Feb 1624 5.Esmé Stuart, 3rd Duke of Lennox+ b. c 1579, d. 30 Jul 1624
2 CONT
