1 NAME Françoise /de Montesquiou d'Artagnan/
2 GIVN Françoise
2 SURN de Montesquiou d'Artagnan
2 _MARNM de Montesquiou d'Artagnan
2 NICK Francoise De Batz Castlemore Dulonge D'artangon (De Montesquiou D'artagnan)
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 11 JAN 1581
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lupiac
3 STAE Occitanie
3 CTRY France
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 SEP 1656
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lupiac
3 STAE Occitanie
3 CTRY France
1 OCCU Dame de Castelmore
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LYHN-VQ5/francoise-de-montesquiou-d'artagnan-1580-1656
2 CONT
2 CONT >When Françoise De Montesquiou d'Artagnan was born in 1580, her father, Seigneur Jean de Montesquiou ,seigneur d' Artagnan, was 30 and her mother, Claude de Bazillac, was 20. She married Seigneur Bertrand de Batz de Castelmore on 
2 CONC 6 February 1608, in Artagnan, Hautes-Pyrénées, Midi-Pyrénées, France. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 27 September 1656, in Lupiac, Gers, Midi-Pyrénées, France, at the age of 76, and was burie
2 CONC d in Lupiac, Gers, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles de Batz de Castlemore, was the son of Bertrand de Batz who was the son of a newly ennobled merchant and held the title of Seigneur de Castlemore et de la Plagne. His mother Francoise de Montesquiou D'Artagnan, came from ve
2 CONC ry old noble family from Gascony. Charles was born between 1611 and 1615 at the Chateau de Castlemore, county of Fezensac near Lupiac.
2 CONT
