2 CONT
2 CONT >Jeanne "d'Artagnan" is presented as daughter of Bertrand de Batz de Castelmore (dit d'Artagnan). This Jeanne de Batz de Castelmore was born after 1608 (parent's marriage), too late to be the mother of Olivier (born c. 1615). And 
2 CONC she married, not Estavan Charbonneau, but Jean-Antoine d'Orfeuille. *Revue du Béarn, 1883 (and the 3-4 next pages
2 CONT
2 CONT https://historytheinterestingbits.com/2016/12/30/the-real-dartagnan/
