2 CONT '''Robert Hamilton here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Hamilton-2nd-Earl-of-Haddington/6000000029363936639?through=6000000222562176860 and his first wife https://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-Erskine/600
2 CONC 0000003890761514. He is reported to have been born on 6 April 1633, and to have died young. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/317/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 317] His baptis
2 CONC m was registered on 6 August 1633, at Edinburgh in Midlothian, Scotland. His baptismal record reads as follows: "Thomas Lord Binning. Dame Catharine Erskin a sonne named Robert. Witn. Robert Earle of Roxburgh Johnne Earl of Ananda
2 CONC ill Robert Viscount of Belhaven." [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Baptisms, reference OPR.685/1] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000222563119941 Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
