2 CONT '''According to Sir James Balfour Paul, Mary Leslie married Hugh, Lord Montgomerie, afterwards seventh Earl of Eglinton. The marriage contract was dated 7 and 24 December 1635. Her tocher was 25,000 merks Scots. [https://archive.o
2 CONC rg/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/453/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, III, p. 451]'''
