2 CONT Bernard Howard was born on 16 October 1641. He was the son of Henry Frederick Howard, 22nd Earl of Arundel and Lady Elizabeth Stuart. He married Catherine Tattershall, daughter of George Tattershall, on 16 June 1672. He died on 21
2 CONC  October 1717 at age 76.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Bernard Howard and Catherine Tattershall
