2 CONT
2 CONT Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier was born on 15 October 1605 at Château de Gaillon, France.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier and Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse.3,1
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean-Baptiste Gaston, Duc d'Orléans, son of Henri IV, Roi de France and Marie de Medici, on 6 August 1626 at Nantes, Bretagne, France.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 4 June 1627 at age 21 at The Louvre, Paris, France.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier gained the title of Duchesse de Montpensier.1 Child of Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier and Jean-Baptiste Gaston, Duc d'Orléans
2 CONT
2 CONT >#  Anne-Marie Louise d'Orléans, Duchesse de Montpensier1 b. 29 May 1627, d. 5 Apr 1693
