1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/DeHarcourt-51
2 CONT
2 CONT Susanna DeHarcourt[1][2][3] was born in 1690 in Muehlhausen, Neumarkt in der Oberpfalz, Bayern, Germany, the fifth or sixth of seven known children and the third of three daughters of Jean de Harcourt and Judith LeSeure.
2 CONT Alternate information: She arrived in Pennsylvania in 1726.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Bertolet and bore him nine known children, four sons and five daughters:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Susanna Bertolet
2 CONT # John S Bertolet
2 CONT # Esther Bertolet
2 CONT # Margaret Bertolet
2 CONT # Marie Berthault
2 CONT # Abraham Bertolet
2 CONT # Peter Bertolet
2 CONT # Maria Magdelana Bertolet
2 CONT # Frederick Bertolet
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1755, when she was in her mid-sixties, she died in 1755 in Oley, Berks County, Pennsylvania, of unknown causes.
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
