2 CONC hurches, churchyards, antiquities Etc. By Rev. William Temple, Ma., FSA. Scot. (D. Wyllie and Son, Aberdeen, 1894), 721 pp. including index, with addenda and corrigenda]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/shortaccountoffa00wimb/page/n10/mode/1up A Short Account of the Family of Irvine of Drum in the County of Aberdeen. By Captain Douglas Wimberley (Inverness, 1893), 74 pp.]'''
