1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JANET DOUGLAS ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Stirnet has suggested that Janet Douglas, here treated, may be the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/William-Douglas-Hamilton-1st-Earl-of-Selkirk/5260144264140120453?through=6000000180830619832 and his wife ht
2 CONC tps://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Hamilton-3rd-Duchess-of-Hamilton/5260120766220057577?through=5260144264140120453 but this is wrong. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/mm4fz/muirhead1.php Stirnet: Muirhead 1]'''</blockquote
2 CONC >
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Janet Douglas, here treated, is not mentioned in the Scots Peerage accounts of her father and his family. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun07paul/page/516/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VII: 516] [https://archive.org/de
2 CONC tails/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/381/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 381] However she is the bastard daughter of William Douglas, Duke of Hamilton, formerly Earl of Selkirk, by an unknown mother. [NRS: RS42/VIII/119 and RS42/X
2 CONC I/301]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Janet Douglas, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Gavin-Muirhead-of-Lauchope/6000000138910909980?through=6000000180830619832 [NRS: RS42/VIII/119 and RS42/XI/301]'''
2 CONT
