2 CONT "<strong>Alexander, third Lord Forbes of Pitsligo</strong>, succeeded his father, and died December 1690, aged about thirty-five. He married, in 1676, Sophia Erskine, daughter of John, Earl of Mar, and by her, who survived till Ju
2 CONC ne 1734, had issue : 
2 CONT * Alexander, his heir. 
2 CONT * Mary, married, first, to John Forbes, younger of Monymusk, and, secondly, as his first wife, to James, sixteenth Lord Forbes, by both of whom she had issue."
2 CONT
