2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Jean Keith is the daughter of John Keith, 1st Earl of Kintore and Lady Margaret Hamilton.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir William Forbes of Monymusk, 4th Bt., son of Sir John Forbes of Monymusk, 3rd Bt. and Hon. Margaret Arbuthnott.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Jean Keith and Sir William Forbes of Monymusk, 4th Bt.
2 CONT
2 CONT # John Forbes+2 d. 13 Jan 1715.  Married Mary Forbes.
2 CONT # Jean Forbes, b. Abt 1696.  Married William Moir.
2 CONT # Mary Forbes+3 b. 1698.  Married William Urquhart of Meldrum.
2 CONT # William Forbes, Born 11 Apr 1698 in Old Machar, Aberdeenshire, Scotland.  
2 CONT
