1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ALEXANDER MONTGOMERIE, EARL OF LOUDOUN===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogical Accounts===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/454/mode/2up The Scots peerage, Vol. III, pp. 452-454]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[https://archive.org/stream/genealogicalhera02byuburk#page/1401/mode/1up ST. QUINTON FAMILY]===
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''A genealogical and heraldic history of the landed gentry of Great Britain & Ireland (1879) Vol. II.
2 CONT *https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhera02byuburk
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/genealogicalhera02byuburk#page/1402/mode/1up
2 CONT *   SIR WILLIAM ST. QUINTIN, 1st bart, of Harpham, s. his father, and was created a Bart. 8 March, 1642, High Sheriff co. York 1648, b. 1579 ; m. Mary, dau. and co-heir of Robert Lacy, Esq. of Folkton, co. York, by whom (who d. 4 
2 CONC May, 1649) he had issue, 
2 CONT **	I. HENRY (Sir), 2nd bart. 
2 CONT **	II. William, of Hayton, b. 1619 ; m. Margaret, dau. of Thomas Wood, Esq. of Thorpe-juxta-Rudston, co. York, d. April, 1687, having had five sons and four daus. 
2 CONT **	III. John, d. s. p. v. p. 
2 CONT **	IV. Thomas, of Flamborough, b. 1620; m. Anne, dau. of Thomas Wood, Esq. of Thorpe, and had one son and one dau. 
2 CONT **	I. Dorothy, m. Sir William Cayley, 1st bart. of Brompton. 
2 CONT **	II. Frances, to. Francis Lascelles, Esq. 
2 CONT **	III. Everille, d. unm. 
2 CONT **	IV. Elizabeth, d. unm. 
2 CONT **'''	V. Katherine''', m. 1st, Michael Wentworth, Esq. of Woolley; 2ndly, Sir John Kaye, 1st bart. of Woodsome ; 3rdly, Henry Sandys, Esq. ; and '''4thly, Alexander, 8th Earl of Eglinton'''. 
2 CONT *Sir William was buried at Harpham, 8 Oct. 1649, and was s. by his eldest son, 
2 CONT *   SIR HENRY ST. QUINTON, 2nd bart. of Harpham, b. 1606; m. Mary, dau. of Henry Stapleton, Esq. of Wighill, co. York, and had surviving issue, .... etc.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/454/mode/2up The Scots peerage, Vol. III, pp. 452-454]
2 CONT * [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/456/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, Vol. III, pp. 456-58]
2 CONT * https://stirnet.com/genie/data/british/mm4fz/montgomery04.php#daumar
2 CONT * https://archive.org/stream/genealogicalhera02byuburk#page/1401/mode/1up
2 CONT *https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhera02byuburk
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/genealogicalhera02byuburk#page/1402/mode/1up
