1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Antonio I Grimaldi''', Prince of Monaco, born January 25, 1661 at Paris, died January 20, 1731, age 70
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Marie-de-Lorraine/5294726780490132221?through=5294726672100132215 Marie de Lorraine-Armagnac, Princess of Monaco]
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Elisabeth-Dufort/5294743322010030488?through=5294726672100132215 Elisabeth Dufort] (mistress, a dancer)
2 CONT # Unnamed mistress
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Victoire-Vertu/6000000012831536750?through=5294726672100132215 Victoire Vertu] (mistress, dancer at the Paris opera)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Children of Antonio I and Marie de Lorraine-Armagnac:
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Louise-Hippolyte-Grimaldi/5294705863230117671?through=5294726780490132221 Louise Hippolyte Grimaldi]
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Margaretha-Camilla-Grimaldi/6000000000129400285?through=5294705863230117671 Margaretha Camilla Grimaldi]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Antonio I and Elizabeth Dufort:
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Antoine-Chevalier-de-Grimaldi/5294750704900132343?through=5294726672100132215 Antoine, Chevalier de Grimaldi]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Antonio I and Unknown:
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Louise-Marie-Th%C3%A9r%C3%A8se-Grimaldi/6000000012831788362?through=5294726672100132215 Louise Marie Thérèse Grimaldi]
2 CONT
2 CONT  * Daughter of Antonio I and Victoire Vertu:
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Antoinette-Grimaldi/6000000012830418530?through=5294726672100132215 Antoinette Grimaldi, mademoiselle de Saint-Rémy]
2 CONT
2 CONT Antonio I was the son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Louis-Grimaldi/5294756233670132138?through=5294726672100132215 Louis I Grimaldi] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-Charlotte-de-Gramont/5294756426260132144?through=52947
2 CONC 56233670132138 Catherine-Charlotte de Gramont]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Royal house ==
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.geni.com/projects/House-of-Grimaldi House of Grimaldi]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Antonio I was the Prince of Monaco from 1701 to 1731. He was the elder son of Louis I, Prince of Monaco and Catherine Charlotte de Gramont.
2 CONT
