2 CONT
2 CONT Titles, styles, honours and arms Royal styles of Françoise Marie, Duchess of Orléans Blason France moderne.svg Reference style 	Her Royal Highness Spoken style 	Your Royal Highness Alternative style 	Madame d'Orléans [edit] Titles
2 CONC  and styles
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 4 May 1677 – 22 November 1681 Françoise Marie de Bourbon
2 CONT     * 22 November 1681 – 18 February 1692 Her Highness[28] Françoise Marie de Bourbon, Legitimée de France, "Mademoiselle de Blois"
2 CONT     * 18 February 1692 – 9 June 1701 Her Royal Highness the Duchess of Chartres (Son Altesse royale Madame la duchesse de Chartres)[29]
2 CONT     * 9 June 1701 – 2 December 1723 Her Royal Highness the Duchess of Orléans (Son Altesse royale Madame la duchesse d'Orléans)
2 CONT     * 2 December 1723 – 1 February 1749 Her Royal Highness the Dowager Duchess of Orléans (Son Altesse royale Madame la Duchesse d'Orléans Douairière)
2 CONT           o From 1709 Françoise Marie was entitled to be addressed as Madame la Princesse but due to her husband not using the style, Françoise Marie did not either.
2 CONT
