2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hugh_Rose%2C_15th_of_Kilravock
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Rose, 15th Baron of Kilravock and Chief of Clan Rose, (1663–1732) was one of the Scottish representatives to the first Parliament of Great Britain as MP for Nairnshire.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rose married, firstly, '''Margaret Campbell''', daughter of Sir Hugh Campbell, 5th of Cawdor and Lady Henrietta Stuart, daughter of James Stuart, 4th Earl of Moray, on 19 October 1683.  They  had three children.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Hugh Rose, 16th of Kilravock (died 1755), MP for Ross-shire.
2 CONT # Margaret Rose (died 1703), married Sir John Mackenzie of Coul, 3rd Baronet, had issue
2 CONT # Mary Rose (died 1734), [sic: before 1717] married Duncan Forbes, 5th of Culloden, had issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT She is described on page 382 of ‘’The Family of Rose’’: < [https://books.google.com/books?id=rb9GCo3_bqYC&pg=PA382&lpg=PA382&dq=elizabeth+calder+rose+hugh+rose&source=bl&ots=byyVeDyTYY&sig=1FRBsUcK2e-cSvhzri7ON7nFPBk&hl=en&sa=X&ve
2 CONC d=0CC4Q6AEwA2oVChMI9v-D8YulyAIVSC2ICh1WzwKL#v=onepage&q=elizabeth%20calder%20rose%20hugh%20rose&f=false GoogleBooks] >
2 CONT
2 CONT >‘’ His first Lady was '''Margaret Campbell''', eldest daughter of Sir Hugh Campbell of Calder and Lady Henriette Stuart, daughter of James Earl of Muray and of Lady Margaret Home, daughter of the Earl of Home. Kilravock married t
2 CONC his Lady on the 19th of October 1683, and she died in the year ….. having brought him a son, Hugh, and two daughters, viz., Margaret, married to Sir John Mackenzie of Coul, and Mary, married to Mr. Duncan Forbes, Advocate, (and af
2 CONC terwards Lord Advo- cate, President of the College of Justice, and Laird of Culloden,) to whom she bore John Forbes now of Culloden.’’
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Campbell-8924 lists in narrative Margaret Campbell’s children, no citation: 
2 CONT
2 CONT # Hugh Rose, 16th of Kilravock d. May 1755
2 CONT # Margaret Rose d. c 1703
2 CONT # Alexandrina Rose - b. 1688
2 CONT # Caroline Rose - b. 1689
2 CONT # Mary Rose
2 CONT
2 CONT Her FamilySearch profile #GZNH-DJ5 lists her siblings as: Archibald, John, Jean, Alexander, Mary, George, Frances, Colin, Sophia, Hugh, Robert and Anna. No proof has been found for this list of siblings
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
