1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Jane Campbell''' was the daughter of Archibald Campbell, 9th Earl of Argyll and Lady Mary Stuart.1 She died on 31 July 1712.1. . 
2 CONT
2 CONT A contract for the marriage of Lady Jane Campbell and Lt.-Gen. William Kerr, 2nd Marquess of Lothian was signed on 30 June 1685.1.  After her marriage, Lady Jane Campbell was styled as Marchioness of Lothian on 15 February 1702/3.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Jane Campbell and Lt.-Gen. William Kerr, 2nd Marquess of Lothian:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Lady Anne Kerr+1 d. 1727
2 CONT # Lady Jean Kerr+1 d. 1768
2 CONT # Lady Elizabeth Kerr+1 d. 22 May 1758
2 CONT # Lady Mary Kerr+1 d. 17 Nov 1768
2 CONT # William Kerr, 3rd Marquess of Lothian+2 b. c 1690, d. 28 Jul 1767
2 CONT
