1 NAME Honourable John Campbell of Mamore, MP for Dunbartonshire
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Kilmun, Argyll and Bute, Scotland
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1659
2 ADDR
