1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == DAVID GRANT ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Bogus Genealogy'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''It has been claimed that David Grant, here treated, is the same person as David Grant of Limepots, who married Janet Lamb at Scone in Perthshire in 1711. This is wrong. [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/213302526
2 CONC /david-grant Find A Grave Memorial] [See also the below mentioned biography proposed for Janet Lamb]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''It has also been claimed that it was David Grant, here treated, who died at Edinburgh on 18 January 1750. [https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/9QRZ-7SH/david-grant-1693-1750 FamilySearch] This is wrong. The death 
2 CONC recorded at Edinburgh on that date belongs to a "founder from Portsburgh" and not to the son of the Laird of Grant, or to the heritable proprietor of the Limepots estate. [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=600000008260160
2 CONC 7261 Image of Death Record]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''David Grant, here treated, is not mentioned in Sir William Fraser's account of the family of Ludovick Grant of that Ilk, otherwise Lewis Grant of that Ilk, and his first wife Janet Brody, [https://archive.org/details/chiefsofgr
2 CONC antmv100fras/page/291/mode/1up The Chiefs of Grant I: pp, 291-330] but he was their son, possibly their youngest child. He was born on 14 January 1693 and his baptism was registered on 27 January 1693, at Edinburgh in Midlothian, 
2 CONC Scotland. His baptismal record reads as follows: "ffriday 27 Janr 1693 Lewis Grant of that Ilk & Joanet Brodie a. s. n. David W. Patrick, Lord Boyd, Sir John Hall of Dunglass, provost of Edinburgh, George Clerk, merchant in Edinbu
2 CONC rgh, late bailie of Edinburgh, James Pringle of Torwoodie, [John] Gordon of Rothiemay, Sir James Ogilvie, advocate, Sir James Calder of Muirtown, William Gray of Richerton, Sir James Grant of Davey, advocate, Mr. Francis Grant of 
2 CONC Ballintomb, born Saterday 14 instant afternoon". [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Baptisms, 1692-95, reference OPR.685/1/12] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173992161826 Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/chiefsofgrantmv100fras/page/n6/mode/1up The Chiefs of Grant. By William Fraser, LL.D. Vol. I. Memoirs (Edinburgh, 1883), 545 pp.]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/chiefsofgrantv200fras/page/n4/mode/1up The Chiefs of Grant. By William Fraser, LL.D. Vol. II. Correspondence (Edinburgh, 1883), 568 pp.]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/chiefsofgrantmv300fras/page/n4/mode/1up The Chiefs of Grant. By William Fraser, LL.D. Vol. III. Charters (Edinburgh, 1883), 597 pp. including indexes]
2 CONT # [http://www.martygrant.com/genealogy/grant/grant-william.htm William Grant and Mary of Rutherford]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Bogus Marriage proposed for Janet Lamb ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet Lamb Birth abt 1693 1 '''David Grant, M Birth 29 Jan 1693, Freuchie, Perth, Scotland''' Birth Memo Parish Church of Kinnoull Father 1st Laird of Grant Ludovic Grant 8th Laird of Freuchie, M (1652-1716) Mother Janet Brodie, F
2 CONC  (~1656-1697) Marriage 25 Oct 1711, Kinnoul, Pert, Scotland Children: Patrick, M (1723-) William, M (1725-1795) Father David Grant, M (1693-) Mother Janet Lamb, F (~1693-) 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Janet (Lamb) Grant (married David Grant (abt 29 Jan 1693 - aft 1693)) is the mother of one child and the grandmother of 8 grandchildren. Listed below are details on up to five generations of descendants. See Janet's Family Tree
2 CONC  & Genealogy Tools for more views.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT William Grant ancestors descendants (abt 1725 - abt 1795) m. Mary Morris (abt 1725 - abt 1800). Andrew Grant ancestors (abt 1755 - abt 1825) m. Martha Mackey (abt 1760 - Feb 1850) on 18 Dec 1788. Clementine Grant ancestors (abt 17
2 CONC 55 - abt 1825) Alexander Grant ancestors (abt 1756 - abt 1804) Elizabeth Grant ancestors (abt 1758 - abt 1815) Charles Grant ancestors (abt 1760 - abt 1800) William Grant Jr ancestors descendants (abt 1762 - abt 1782) Thomas Grant
2 CONC  ancestors descendants (abt 1773 - abt 1861) m. Amy Coxey (1779 - abt 1851) on 5 Aug 1801. Andrew Grant ancestors descendants (abt 04 Apr 1810 - abt 1861) m. Sarah Whitaker (abt 12 Jun 1812). John Grant ancestors descendants (abt 
2 CONC 25 Jan 1850 - abt 28 Jul 1922) Thomas Grant ancestors (abt 1774 - abt 1859) m. Amy Coxey (1779 - abt 1851). Archibald Grant ancestors (abt 1775 - abt 1800) 
2 CONT
2 CONT
