2 CONC age Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 19 2016, 4:25:04 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Bogus Death Date and Place for David Grant, son of Ludovick Grant of Freuchie and Grant ==
2 CONT
2 CONT David Grant was born on January 14 1693, to Ludovic ("The Highland King") Grant VIII Laird and Janet Grant (born Brodie). Ludovic was born in 1641, in Grant, Ross Ross and Cromarty, Scotland. Janet was born in 1656, in Lethen, Nai
2 CONC rn, Scotland. David had 9 siblings: Janet MacKenzie (born Grant), John Grant and 7 other siblings. Documents of David Grant David Grant in Scotland, Marriages, 1561-1910 Janet Lamb married David Grant in 1711 in Kinnoul, Perth, Sc
2 CONC otland.  '''David Grant died at age 57, January 1750,''' and was buried at St. Cuthbert’s Church in Edinburgh, Scotland.
2 CONT
