2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anna Barclay married Mungo Buchanan of Hilton, WS. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=RH8%2f216&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Mungo+Buchanan&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of 
2 CONC Scotland, Register House charters, reference RH8/216] The marriage was booked on 21 January 1687, at Edinburgh in Midlothian, Scotland. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Marriages, reference OPR.685/1/44]''' 
2 CONT
