2 CONT
2 CONT Antonia Barclay, Lady of Collairnie, was a very young child when she succeeded her father in the estate of Collairnie. She was served heir to him in the Bailiary of the Abbacy of Lindores, January 9th, and in the lands and Barony 
2 CONC of Collairnie, February 21st, 1710-11.
