2 CONC t II. (Harrison, London, 1863)  pp. 1050-51 for Muirhead of Bredisholm]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/systemofheraldry02nisb/page/256/mode/1up A System of Heraldry etc. By Alexander Nisbet. The Second Edition. Volume II (Alex Lawrie and Company, Edinburgh, 1904), pp. 256-66 for Muirhead of Lauchop
