2 CONT
2 CONT '''Captain  James Muirhead of Lauchope: "the second son, parted with any small remainder of the estate, and going also into the army, came to be a captain in the Earl of Orkney's regiment, in which he continued, after it  was, on 
2 CONC the Earl's demise, given to Colonel Sinclair; in which station he died in the end of the 1738 in Ireland, leaving no issue, save two daughters." [https://archive.org/details/systemofheraldry02nisb/page/264/mode/1up A System of Her
2 CONC aldry II: 254]'''
2 CONT
