2 CONT * Catherine Gore
2 CONT * Jane Gore
2 CONT * Elizabeth Gore
2 CONT * Mary Gore
2 CONT * Sir St. George St. George, 5th Bt. b. b 1725, d. 25 Sep 1746
2 CONT * General Ralph Gore, 1st and last Earl of Ross b. 23 Nov 1725, d. 1802
2 CONT * Richard Gore b. 16 Oct 1728, d. 1816
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://www.thepeerage.com/p23361.htm#i233609 The Peerage]
