1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Margaret</strong>, married in 1677 to Sir Thomas Burnett, third Baronet of Leys, by whom she had twenty-one children. Sir Thomas died in 1714, survived by his widow, who died in 1744 at the age of eighty-two."
