2 CONC tland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD32%2f24%2f74&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+wallace&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Viscounts and Barons of Elibank, reference GD3
2 CONC 2/24/74]'''
