1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Graham, Baronet [s. 1665], of Gartmore</strong>, only s. and h., who, with his father, had a Crown Charter of that estate, 23 April 1672; suc. to the Baronetcy in Dec. 1684, was served heir general of his father,
2 CONC  16 Feb. 1687, and heir spec, in the estate of Gartmore, 12 Feb. 1695. He became insane 1696. He d. unm. 12 July 1708, when the Baronetcy became extinct."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n263/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 244
