1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rebecca Johnson was born on November 8, 1688 in St Peters Parish, New Kent, Virginia, the daughter of Edward Johnson and Elizabeth (Walker) Johnson.  Rebecca married Nathaniel (Hix) Hicks. She died 1698 in Goochlan
