2 CONC ear=1765&parent_names=James&parent_names_so=soundex&parent_name_two=Ma%2Aui%2A&parent_name_two_so=wild&sort=asc&order=Date&field=year Scotland's People: Old Parish Registers: Births and Baptisms]'''
