2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse's first name(s)	Eliz Spouse's last name	Cullen Spouse's residence	Folkestone
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes	 He s.of Stan. and Sara, wool stapler of London,she d.of Thos.and Jane,fisherman County	Kent Country	England Archive	Canterbury Cathedral Archives
2 CONT
