2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Vittoria Francesca of Savoy, Princess of Carignan (9 February 1690 – 8 July 1766) was an illegitimate daughter of Victor Amadeus II of Sardinia and his favourite mistress Jeanne Baptiste d'Albert de Luynes, estranged wife of
2 CONC  Joseph Ignace Scaglia, Count of Verua.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was an ancestor of Victor Emmanuel II of Italy and thus the whole present pretending Italian Royal Family. She is also a descendant of the pretenders of France.
2 CONT
