2 CONT Pierre and François the MAISTRE, his sons
2 CONT Michel NINE, rider, sior of the Hedgehog, civil and criminal lieutenant of Three-Rivers
2 CONT Young lady Marguerite LEGARDEUR, woman of Jacques NINE of the Pottery
2 CONT Louis GODEFROY of Normanville, rider, tax prosecutor of this place
2 CONT Damoiselle Marguerite SEIGNEURET, her wife
