2 CONT
2 CONT Élisabeth RADISSON married Claude JUTRAS; she is the sister of Francoise and thus the girl of the famous Pierre-Spirit RADISSON, intermediary, whose name related to is closely discovered roads for the trade of the fur . Jean-Franç
2 CONC ois, wire of FLYING Claude and Francoise RADISSON is a merchant of fur .
2 CONT
2 CONT In the next article, we will try to highlight these bonds extremely invaluable and filling with enthusiasm for research.
2 CONT
