2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/8812915/clothilde-zeller Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jul 13 2019, 0:58:58 UTC'' 
