1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://gw3.geneanet.org/pierfit?lang=nl;p=pierre+paul;n=d+ossun gw3.geneanet.org....] - (Dutch language) ; [http://www.wga.hu/html_m/l/loo/cesar/ossun.html Pierre Paul d'Ossun, marquis d'Ossun.] ; 
2 CONT * Pierre Paul, marquis d'Ossun (1713-1788), was of ancient aristocratic lineage. The first part of his adult life was spent in the French royal army. In 1751 he entered the diplomatic corps to became the ambassador to the Kingdom 
2 CONC of Naples and the Two Sicilies. In 1759 he was sent to Madrid as Louis XV's official representative at the Spanish court. In 1778, the year after his return to France, Louis XVI appointed him minister in the Council of State.
2 CONT * M  Pierre Paul d'Ossun, marquis d'Ossun
2 CONT * Geboren op 28 januari 1713
2 CONT * Overleden in 1788 - Paris (75) , leeftijd bij overlijden: 75 jaar oud
2 CONT * Capitaine lieutenant des chevau-légers de la Reine, ambassadeur auprès des Rois de Deux-Siciles puis d'Espagne.
2 CONT ===Ouders===
2 CONT * François Gaspard d'OSSUN †1721
2 CONT * Marie Charlotte de PAS 1689-1759
2 CONT ===Huwelijken en kinderen===
