2 CONT     ^ Mémoires de La Grande Mademoiselle, Troisième partie, chapitre 3, http://penelope.uchicago.edu/mlle/partie3/chap303.html
2 CONT     ^ The former Hôtel de Toulouse is now the seat of the Banque de France.
2 CONT     ^ The château de Chanteloup was demolished in the 19th century.
