1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/170807780/abraham-fry
2 CONT
2 CONT See Reconstructed census 1774-1810, Berkeley Co.Va W929.3 G919r at Colson Hall. Huffman-Fry in tax records. Christina and Abraham Fry both together. See Earliest Settlers of Frederick and Hampshire Co.Va Book W929.3 at Colson Hall
2 CONC .pp 172. See Deed Book 11, page 370, Hampshire Co. Virginia Court House Record for a list of Abraham Frys children( late of Berkeley Co.Va. decd bef 1798). Abraham had land on the "Waters of Cacapon". check deeds, wills,estates, e
2 CONC tc of Berkely Co,(W) Va in Martinsburg Court House. Abraham lived "onm the Waters of Little Cacapon" acc to deeds. There was another Abraham Fry of Fallowfield twp, Washington Co. Pa, decd ca 1809 and he had land on " Lost River o
2 CONC f Cacapon" in (W)Va. They very likely were related somehow.
