1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michel_du_Motier,_Marquis_de_La_Fayette
2 CONT
2 CONT Michel Louis Christophe Motier de La Fayette, marquis de La Fayette (13 August 1731 – 9 July 1759) was a colonel in the French Grenadiers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Life
2 CONT
2 CONT He was killed by a cannonball at the Battle of Minden in the Seven Years' War.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Minden
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT On 22 May 1754, he married Marie, Louise, Jolie de la Rivière.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was father of the better-known Gilbert du Motier, marquis de Lafayette who played a significant role in the American Revolution and French Revolution.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Philippe of Belgium's 6-Great Grandfather. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --
2 CONT
2 CONT  Wife/Partner:       Marie Louise Julie de la RIVIERE 
2 CONT  Child:       Marie Joseph Yves Paul `Gilbert' MOTIER de la FAYETTE 
2 CONT
2 CONT --
2 CONT
2 CONT   His 2-Great Grandchild:       Luisa PERRONE di SAN MARTINO 
2 CONT
2 CONT   His 6-Great Grandchild:       Philippe Leopold Louis Marie (Crown Prince) of BELGIUM 
2 CONT
2 CONT --
2 CONT
2 CONT Fra
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fabpedigree.com/s096/f625599.htm
