2 CONT Biography Campbell was returned in 1736 on the interest of his first cousin, John, Duke of Argyll, whom he followed into opposition, voting against the Spanish convention in 1739. Returned again in 1741, he died 8 Oct. 1741 in Jam
2 CONC aica.
