2 CONC o so. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD18%2f3275&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+calderwood+of+polton&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of Clerk family 
2 CONC of Penicuik, Midlothian, reference GD18/3275]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
