2 CONT '''28 July 1786: Polton: Tack granted by Mrs Margaret Stewart, alias Calderwood, wife to and Factrix and Commissioner for Mr Thomas Calderwood of Polton, advocate, to Robert Lees, tenant in Brockhouse, of the lands of Brockhouse, 
2 CONC for 31 years from Whitsunday 1766. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD113%2f5%2f257&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+calderwood+of+polton&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of 
2 CONC Scotland, Papers of the Innes family of Stow, Peeblesshire, reference GD113/5/257]'''
