2 CONT Margaret was the daughter of Sir James Stuart of Coltness and Goodtrees , a Steuart baronet.[1] and the granddaughter of Sir Henry Dalrymple (Page 40 The Calderwood Familes of Scotland, Ireland and America by Albert A Taylor) Cont
