2 CONC (Stroud, Gloucestershire, U.K.: Sutton Publishing, 1998), page 48. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage, Volume XIV. 2.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmingto
2 CONC n, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 3, page 3786. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition. 3.[S75] Lord Strathspey, A History of Clan Grant (U.K.: Phillimore, 198
